# General style

* When writing brand-new *.py,*.ts files, apply canonical style,
  like no trailing whitespaces
* When editing existing files, follow the established style in the file,
  if the style is mixed in the files,
  use your best judgement to apply certain style
* Whenever possible, use lint tool to verify your style
